# ── issue #4 BLOCKER: prompt-delivery children must not inherit fd 8 — RETIRED (B glue cut 2) ──────
# 4 assertion(s) went with their subject: the whole launch and resume is ONE core operation now (`_launch`,
# src/session_launch.rs): the argv grammar, the resume decision, the command
# build, the context injection, the launch script and its paste all moved with
