# NOTE: the watchdog's quiet-state behaviour (done/waiting-user/blocked
# suppression + the waiting-user/blocked pane-activity escape hatch) is the
# core's daemon since A.3 and is covered by its own tests. A live-watchdog
# integration test is still not practical here: the watchdog runs in a tmux
