# `--pane=#{pane_id}` IS THE FIXTURE'S OWN CORRECTNESS, not a widening of what
# is under test. Self-ness is answered from the caller's pane, and in a
# `run-shell` child $TMUX_PANE is INHERITED and names a FOREIGN pane (the same
# measured fact the documented recipe exists for) — so without the explicit
# expansion this child is not detectably inside the fleet at all, the core takes
# the outside-caller path, and the seed would be testing the opposite case while
# still looking like this one. The (e) arm above reaches the same state through
