# Surface: root install, ae-entry, four-member bundle. Coexistence isolation
# (AE_NEXT_HOME, ~/.ae-next, shared-extract parity) is retired. Live invariants
# ported: first install layout, 0555, core/current, command link, identical
# re-run, different-bytes refuse, version-mismatch refuse, upgrade beside old,
# config untouched, B8 inherited-env, missing-core refuse, F8 directory-leaf,
# B14 dangling .local, core/current symlink refuse.

P5I_SRC="$(dirname "$AE")"
P5I_ROOT="$TMPDIR/p5inst"
